// UI CONTRACT v1 (UI01 Final Contract v1)
// Design language and responsibility boundaries are frozen; exact pixels are not.
export type CausePublicLevel='explicit'|'hinted'|'hidden';
// Cause mapping: journal=>explicit, hint=>hinted, hidden=>not sent.
RUN_HOME is the main Home during an active Run. LIFE_ARCHIVE is its read-only side page.
RUN_HOME presents public status and exactly four core action intents: 闭关(cultivate), 游历(travel), 入世(worldly), 追索(pursuit).
Actions submit Command Envelope intent only; UI never computes authoritative outcomes.
EVENT is a full-page decision model showing only public scene data, options and server-built riskPresentation. An unresolved EVENT cannot be escaped through ordinary back navigation.
SPECIAL_NODE is a generic structured-node container. UI01 freezes page-state/submission/retry/recovery/projection boundaries, not full gameplay.
Terminal flow is ENDING -> LIFE_BOOK -> REBIRTH_RESULT -> NEXT_LIFE. LIFE_BOOK uses actual public facts only.
Capability-aware UI gates entries through DailyChallengeCapability, AdCapability, CommerceCapability, ShareCapability and PlatformCapability. Missing capability hides or safely degrades the entry. wx.xxx/tt.xxx never enter Core or platform-neutral ViewModel.
Daily Challenge UI may expose 今日命局/初赴此命/再赴此命/正式榜/我的排名 and first-life fairness; second life never changes first-life official ranking. DailyChallengeCapability=false hides the entry. Challenge semantics/backend belong to CHAL01.
Commercial fairness: no permanent power, paid breakthrough odds, ad revive, settled-choice rewrite, RNG modification, official-first-life paid/ad information advantage, or paid leaderboard advantage. dailyChallengeSecondLife is deferred to CHAL01 + AdCapability.
Visual language: 宣纸 + 墨 + 朱砂 + 极少暗金 + 大量留白 + 克制动画. UI01 does not freeze HEX, type sizes, spacing, radius, component dimensions or high-fidelity comps; UI02 owns them.
Responsive gameplay layout: RUN_HOME is a one-screen operational surface on supported portrait phone viewports. The page itself must not require vertical scrolling to see core status and all four core actions; an enabled breakthrough action must also be first-screen reachable. Detail density belongs in read-only secondary overlays/side pages, not by extending RUN_HOME downward.
EVENT and SPECIAL_NODE are full-screen decision surfaces. Long narrative or option sets may use bounded internal scrolling, but the page itself must not become an unstructured vertical document and unresolved decisions must keep actionable choices reachable.
LIFE_ARCHIVE is intentionally scrollable read-only history. Development preview controls must overlay/collapse and must not consume the product viewport height. Safe-area/home-indicator space must not cover critical controls.
A12 may implement only WeChat ViewModel projection/builder, page-state plumbing, command submission states, pending/retry integration, platform-neutral contract connection and a minimal WeChat page shell.
A12 must not implement leaderboard backend, CHAL01, full combat, UI02-UI04, new monetization, Cause reinterpretation, or server-secret transmission.
